2. Process Domain Operations
Write a function processDomainOperations(operations) that handles these commands:
"PUT domain ip" → store domain with IP
"GET domain" → return IP or "404"
"COUNT suffix" → return count of stored domains ending with suffix
Return results only for GET and COUNT in order.
Input:
[
  ["PUT", "www.apple.com", "10.20.30.40"],
  ["PUT", "jobs.apple.com", "10.20.30.50"],
  ["PUT", "sites.google.com", "142.258.145.693"],
  ["GET", "sample.com"],
  ["GET", "www.apple.com"],
  ["COUNT", "apple.com"],
  ["COUNT", "com"]
]
Output: ["404", "10.20.30.40", "2", "3"]
